From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yassin <yassin@Nixos>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 23:04:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 22/30] pmdomain: qcom: rpmhpd: add QCS615 LCX

QCS615 command DB advertises the lcx.lvl ARC resource.

Downstream uses this logical PM6150 L8 rail to power the ADSP.

Expose LCX through the QCS615 RPMh power-domain provider.

Signed-off-by: Yassin <yassin@Nixos>
---
 drivers/pmdomain/qcom/rpmhpd.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/pmdomain/qcom/rpmhpd.c b/drivers/pmdomain/qcom/rpmhpd.c
index 907432759..25e410394 100644
--- a/drivers/pmdomain/qcom/rpmhpd.c
+++ b/drivers/pmdomain/qcom/rpmhpd.c
@@ -873,6 +873,7 @@ static const struct rpmhpd_desc qcs8300_desc = {
 static struct rpmhpd *qcs615_rpmhpds[] = {
 	[RPMHPD_CX] = &cx,
 	[RPMHPD_CX_AO] = &cx_ao,
+	[RPMHPD_LCX] = &lcx,
 };
 
 static const struct rpmhpd_desc qcs615_desc = {
